stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Anonymous
    Anonymous --> Authenticating
    Authenticating --> Active: Success
    Authenticating --> Anonymous: Failure
    Active --> Refreshed: Refresh
    Refreshed --> Active
    Active --> Recovery: Reset initiated
    Recovery --> Active: Reset success
    Active --> SignedOut: Logout
    SignedOut --> Anonymous
    Active --> Expired: Refresh fails
    Expired --> Anonymous